(2329131, 322546, 4767, '<td valign="top">I LOVE baby pics!  (Too many here bellyache about them, I''ve noticed).  I will suggest, though, that if you''d gotten more face and a little less tummy it''d be a stronger portrait.  I like that there is a reflection of light filling in on the (to us) right side of the face.  It softens the ''hatchet lighting'' with patches of sunlight and shadows that can take so much of the details from the face.  I hope to see more of that precious smile!</td>', 'I LOVE baby pics!  (Too many here bellyache about them, I''ve noticed).  I will suggest, though, that if you''d gotten more face and a little less tummy it''d be a stronger portrait.  I like that there is a reflection of light filling in on the (to us) right side of the face.  It softens the ''hatchet lighting'' with patches of sunlight and shadows that can take so much of the details from the face.  I hope to see more of that precious smile!', '2006-04-20 11:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2329171, 322640, 44611, '<td valign="top">Love the sense of humour - and the expression on her face is priceless!</td>', 'Love the sense of humour - and the expression on her face is priceless!', '2006-04-20 11:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
