(2330905, 321900, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo and you did a really nice job with the duotone. My only suggestion would be to crop out the fenceline at the top since it draws attention away from your excellent subjects.</td>', 'This is a great photo and you did a really nice job with the duotone. My only suggestion would be to crop out the fenceline at the top since it draws attention away from your excellent subjects.', '2006-04-20 21:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330930, 322546, 26733, '<td valign="top">Nice baby picture. Too bad the lighting wasn''t more consistent on the face to get rid of the shadows.</td>', 'Nice baby picture. Too bad the lighting wasn''t more consistent on the face to get rid of the shadows.', '2006-04-20 22:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330938, 323078, 35804, '<td valign="top">I never get tired of dandelion picture such as this...there is just something so whimsical about them...innocent even...lovely and nicely done.</td>', 'I never get tired of dandelion picture such as this...there is just something so whimsical about them...innocent even...lovely and nicely done.', '2006-04-20 22:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330973, 322524, 35804, '<td valign="top">IMO...I think maybe this would be a bit more interesting if there were a little more "context" to this image...I keep wanting to see more of the setting, where is this surface/wall, where is this situated, is this big city or small town, school or back alley...etc., etc...context, power, dimension...without these, this particular image feels "flat", physically and conceptually.</td>', 'IMO...I think maybe this would be a bit more interesting if there were a little more "context" to this image...I keep wanting to see more of the setting, where is this surface/wall, where is this situated, is this big city or small town, school or back alley...etc., etc...context, power, dimension...without these, this particular image feels "flat", physically and conceptually.', '2006-04-20 22:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330980, 322574, 35804, '<td valign="top">Great concept! What a fresh approach to this challenge...I almost wish I knew what they were talking about...nicely done.</td>', 'Great concept! What a fresh approach to this challenge...I almost wish I knew what they were talking about...nicely done.', '2006-04-20 22:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330986, 322852, 35804, '<td valign="top">Now that''s one teeny weeny turtle!</td>', 'Now that''s one teeny weeny turtle!', '2006-04-20 22:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330994, 322805, 35804, '<td valign="top">Nicely subtle with a soft sensuality about it...lovely point of view, well done.</td>', 'Nicely subtle with a soft sensuality about it...lovely point of view, well done.', '2006-04-20 22:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331000, 321959, 40580, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The lighting is a little harsh and there''s a distracting bright white in the right bottom corner.  I do like the contrast of the yellow and green with the brown tho.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The lighting is a little harsh and there''s a distracting bright white in the right bottom corner.  I do like the contrast of the yellow and green with the brown tho.  Well done.', '2006-04-20 22:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331007, 322837, 40580, '<td valign="top">Very fresh.  Still has umbilical(sp?) cord scab.  A little noisy, but nice conversion to B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very fresh.  Still has umbilical(sp?) cord scab.  A little noisy, but nice conversion to B&W.', '2006-04-20 22:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331010, 323101, 40580, '<td valign="top">Harsh lighting.  Good boken.  Maybe brighten up the colors too.  This is one of the few challenges where image manipulation is okay.</td>', 'Harsh lighting.  Good boken.  Maybe brighten up the colors too.  This is one of the few challenges where image manipulation is okay.', '2006-04-20 22:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
