(2334251, 322895, 41574, '<td valign="top">Another friggin'' iPod? Is this site funded by Apple or something? Good picture, albeit one that looks taken in order to boast a newly acquired possession (but then, what''s wrong with that?).</td>', 'Another friggin'' iPod? Is this site funded by Apple or something? Good picture, albeit one that looks taken in order to boast a newly acquired possession (but then, what''s wrong with that?).', '2006-04-22 00:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334255, 322711, 41574, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, "$182"? Is that right? One hundred and eighty-two U.S. Dollars? That''s the most ridiculous thing I''ve ever heard. Paying ONE HUNDRED AND EIGHTY-TWO UNITED STATES DOLLARS, for a pair of god-damned PANTS. They''re PANTS. I don''t give a "fly" if they shrink your ass down to a "2": THEY ARE PANTS. They''re blue and made of denim, and they''re pants; and it is INSANE to pay $182.00 for a pair of pants. Jeans, at that. Jeans: pants DESIGNED to be worn mainly in casual situations. Hell, even if they were for "professional purposes," they would be ludicrously, and unacceptably over-priced. Wait...what were we doing, again? Right, photo-rating. Umm...nice picture.<br/> <br/>P.S. PANTS.</td>', 'I''m sorry, "$182"? Is that right? One hundred and eighty-two U.S. Dollars? That''s the most ridiculous thing I''ve ever heard. Paying ONE HUNDRED AND EIGHTY-TWO UNITED STATES DOLLARS, for a pair of god-damned PANTS. They''re PANTS. I don''t give a "fly" if they shrink your ass down to a "2": THEY ARE PANTS. They''re blue and made of denim, and they''re pants; and it is INSANE to pay $182.00 for a pair of pants. Jeans, at that. Jeans: pants DESIGNED to be worn mainly in casual situations. Hell, even if they were for "professional purposes," they would be ludicrously, and unacceptably over-priced. Wait...what were we doing, again? Right, photo-rating. Umm...nice picture. P.S. PANTS.', '2006-04-22 00:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
