(2334839, 321578, 30982, '<td valign="top">The egg is too saturated and I realize the border was meant to match the egg, but the end result is it kinda dulls the picture overall.  The expression on the little one''s face is very good, and I like the composotion of just having the adults hands in the picture, too.  I''d have removed the other cup, though.</td>', 'The egg is too saturated and I realize the border was meant to match the egg, but the end result is it kinda dulls the picture overall.  The expression on the little one''s face is very good, and I like the composotion of just having the adults hands in the picture, too.  I''d have removed the other cup, though.', '2006-04-22 12:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334842, 323196, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. At least it isn''t a macro of a flower bud or a baby. LOL They appear to be kind of stuck in a corner? Slightly out of focus but overall, I like it and applaud your originality.</td>', 'Cute idea. At least it isn''t a macro of a flower bud or a baby. LOL They appear to be kind of stuck in a corner? Slightly out of focus but overall, I like it and applaud your originality.', '2006-04-22 12:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334843, 323040, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great DOF. I like his grimacing expression.</td>', 'Great DOF. I like his grimacing expression.', '2006-04-22 12:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334844, 322955, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this not being the typical macro.  It has the entire plant and there is more to it than just the tiny fledgling plant.  Nicely done.  I might have it less centered but other than that, I like it.</td>', 'I like this not being the typical macro.  It has the entire plant and there is more to it than just the tiny fledgling plant.  Nicely done.  I might have it less centered but other than that, I like it.', '2006-04-22 12:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334846, 321606, 15711, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit of a stretch, but I do like the off center. The pink of her hat really draws your eye in. What about an adjustment of curves or levels to really enhance the sand color?</td>', 'Maybe a bit of a stretch, but I do like the off center. The pink of her hat really draws your eye in. What about an adjustment of curves or levels to really enhance the sand color?', '2006-04-22 12:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334850, 322004, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this would have a greater impact and sense of photojournalism if it were done in black and white with HIGH contrast.</td>', 'I think this would have a greater impact and sense of photojournalism if it were done in black and white with HIGH contrast.', '2006-04-22 12:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334852, 322711, 15711, '<td valign="top">CUte idea.  I wish the background were white or black. Maybe you could adjust curves to enrich the colors of blue and give the backgorund a bit more punch. Good placement of the subject.</td>', 'CUte idea.  I wish the background were white or black. Maybe you could adjust curves to enrich the colors of blue and give the backgorund a bit more punch. Good placement of the subject.', '2006-04-22 12:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334853, 322320, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely. I like the deep charcoal tonaes of this with the white and black as accents. 8</td>', 'Lovely. I like the deep charcoal tonaes of this with the white and black as accents. 8', '2006-04-22 12:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334854, 322241, 15711, '<td valign="top">Maybe a touch too soft, or slightly out of focus.  I do like that touch of purple in the background. Nice uDOF and the off centering of the daffodils works well to bring the eye to them.</td>', 'Maybe a touch too soft, or slightly out of focus.  I do like that touch of purple in the background. Nice uDOF and the off centering of the daffodils works well to bring the eye to them.', '2006-04-22 12:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334856, 321052, 15711, '<td valign="top">This should be my trademark~ ha ha ha ha</td>', 'This should be my trademark~ ha ha ha ha', '2006-04-22 12:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334857, 322713, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this one. We see lots of new buds, flowers, plants, but this stands apart.  The earth below adds nice texture, with the light skipping over it.  The two drops of water on the left leaf really add a nice bit of interest.  Great composition. I like it. 8</td>', 'I like this one. We see lots of new buds, flowers, plants, but this stands apart.  The earth below adds nice texture, with the light skipping over it.  The two drops of water on the left leaf really add a nice bit of interest.  Great composition. I like it. 8', '2006-04-22 12:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334858, 321199, 26733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Too bad they are partly in shadow.</td>', 'Nice capture. Too bad they are partly in shadow.', '2006-04-22 12:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334859, 321896, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this would be really pretty if you did a curves adjustment.  It could deepen the sky color and make the leaves stand out more. The focus seems to be on the stem and not the leaves.</td>', 'I think this would be really pretty if you did a curves adjustment.  It could deepen the sky color and make the leaves stand out more. The focus seems to be on the stem and not the leaves.', '2006-04-22 12:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334864, 323157, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Nice use of overall blue tones.  (pssst - the tie isn''t centered ;~p)</td>', 'Cute idea. Nice use of overall blue tones.  (pssst - the tie isn''t centered ;~p)', '2006-04-22 12:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334866, 321808, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice one.  The water drops are tack sharp. Great DOF - like the slight off centered rose.  Nice against the black background.</td>', 'Nice one.  The water drops are tack sharp. Great DOF - like the slight off centered rose.  Nice against the black background.', '2006-04-22 12:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334868, 320187, 15711, '<td valign="top">Tack sharp focus, which makes this work.  Unusual plant.  I like the diagonal line it creates against the black background.</td>', 'Tack sharp focus, which makes this work.  Unusual plant.  I like the diagonal line it creates against the black background.', '2006-04-22 12:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334870, 322805, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like the narrow DOF. It almost looks like it''s turning. Nice frame. Overall - quite artful.</td>', 'Interesting. I like the narrow DOF. It almost looks like it''s turning. Nice frame. Overall - quite artful.', '2006-04-22 12:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334877, 320866, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this with the diagonal formed by the buds.  The focus needs to be sharper on the first bud to really spark the picture.</td>', 'I like the composition of this with the diagonal formed by the buds.  The focus needs to be sharper on the first bud to really spark the picture.', '2006-04-22 13:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334879, 320481, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has potential but the pattern on the floor and the overblown lighting kind of kills the effect. I''d love to see the show turned slightly more to the left, with a solid black background and a single light source with negative space to one side.</td>', 'This has potential but the pattern on the floor and the overblown lighting kind of kills the effect. I''d love to see the show turned slightly more to the left, with a solid black background and a single light source with negative space to one side.', '2006-04-22 13:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334880, 322911, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice composition/crop.</td>', 'Nice composition/crop.', '2006-04-22 13:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334881, 321476, 15711, '<td valign="top">This would have been great were you able to get down level with them instead of looking down.  Adorable little ducklings.</td>', 'This would have been great were you able to get down level with them instead of looking down.  Adorable little ducklings.', '2006-04-22 13:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334889, 321452, 15711, '<td valign="top">Quite striking.  I wonder if the light were a tad more subtle, if it would have been more interesting, skimming over areas here and there on the orchid. I like the black background. The diagonal sense is interesting to the eye as well.</td>', 'Quite striking.  I wonder if the light were a tad more subtle, if it would have been more interesting, skimming over areas here and there on the orchid. I like the black background. The diagonal sense is interesting to the eye as well.', '2006-04-22 13:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334890, 323107, 30982, '<td valign="top">The composition here is very nice - I like the squarish crop, the bud in front of the OOF blooming roses, and the smaller buds below.  Not sure if you saw the spider webs and mites before you shot, but next time you can try hosing off the plant a little before you take the picture (I know, because I have the same problems with my roses.)</td>', 'The composition here is very nice - I like the squarish crop, the bud in front of the OOF blooming roses, and the smaller buds below.  Not sure if you saw the spider webs and mites before you shot, but next time you can try hosing off the plant a little before you take the picture (I know, because I have the same problems with my roses.)', '2006-04-22 13:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334893, 322745, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good new car shot, and that be a Texas plate... :-)</td>', 'Good new car shot, and that be a Texas plate... :-)', '2006-04-22 13:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334896, 322004, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of selective desat.  The one problem with the composition is the pole in the middle that essentially cuts your picture in half.  Appropriate subject for the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting use of selective desat.  The one problem with the composition is the pole in the middle that essentially cuts your picture in half.  Appropriate subject for the challenge.', '2006-04-22 13:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334897, 322909, 30982, '<td valign="top">Weird!</td>', 'Weird!', '2006-04-22 13:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334900, 321955, 15711, '<td valign="top">The DOF would be great if the plant wasn''t oversharpened.</td>', 'The DOF would be great if the plant wasn''t oversharpened.', '2006-04-22 13:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334906, 322281, 30982, '<td valign="top">Adorable and very appropriate to the challenge.  Nice DOF.</td>', 'Adorable and very appropriate to the challenge.  Nice DOF.', '2006-04-22 13:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334907, 322375, 15711, '<td valign="top">Awww a Joey!  How''d you get that close??</td>', 'Awww a Joey!  How''d you get that close??', '2006-04-22 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334913, 323140, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF. I like how the leaves and bloom are emerging from the darkness. Unusual silhouette perspective. The backlight blossom is nicely done with the negative space to the left.</td>', 'Nice DOF. I like how the leaves and bloom are emerging from the darkness. Unusual silhouette perspective. The backlight blossom is nicely done with the negative space to the left.', '2006-04-22 13:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334917, 323123, 49315, '<td valign="top">Wish i could take pics like this 9</td>', 'Wish i could take pics like this 9', '2006-04-22 13:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334990, 323208, 45596, '<td valign="top">nice colors</td>', 'nice colors', '2006-04-22 14:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334991, 322649, 45596, '<td valign="top">cool colors</td>', 'cool colors', '2006-04-22 14:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334994, 320187, 45596, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective</td>', 'Interesting perspective', '2006-04-22 14:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335023, 323086, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good idea for a study in contrasts here.  Bit lacking in the crispness of both the old and new blooms to truly do it justice.</td>', 'Good idea for a study in contrasts here.  Bit lacking in the crispness of both the old and new blooms to truly do it justice.', '2006-04-22 14:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335025, 322546, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the natural light.</td>', 'I like the use of the natural light.', '2006-04-22 14:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335026, 322123, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors and composition.</td>', 'Interesting colors and composition.', '2006-04-22 14:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335028, 322928, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - did you leave them here for the occupants to receive?</td>', 'Heh - did you leave them here for the occupants to receive?', '2006-04-22 14:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335030, 321625, 30982, '<td valign="top">What timing!</td>', 'What timing!', '2006-04-22 14:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335034, 323022, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kind of looks like fully grown grass blades stuck in dirt.</td>', 'Kind of looks like fully grown grass blades stuck in dirt.', '2006-04-22 14:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335039, 322146, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very entertaining portrait - well lit and framed.  Not sure how it fits the challenge, though.</td>', 'A very entertaining portrait - well lit and framed.  Not sure how it fits the challenge, though.', '2006-04-22 14:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335064, 321795, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ilove how perfectly formed roses exist on imperfect plants.  I like this picture better when I scroll so the rose is kinda in the upper left third rather than halfway down (ie crop a bit off the top.)</td>', 'Ilove how perfectly formed roses exist on imperfect plants.  I like this picture better when I scroll so the rose is kinda in the upper left third rather than halfway down (ie crop a bit off the top.)', '2006-04-22 15:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335068, 322914, 30982, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting, the texture of the tree, and the crispness of the new growth.  I might have liked a bit more room on the right to balance the tree trunk.  Good subject for the challenge.</td>', 'Like the lighting, the texture of the tree, and the crispness of the new growth.  I might have liked a bit more room on the right to balance the tree trunk.  Good subject for the challenge.', '2006-04-22 15:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335069, 321199, 30982, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well but unfortunately the little one is too hidden in the shade.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well but unfortunately the little one is too hidden in the shade.', '2006-04-22 15:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335073, 321389, 57169, '<td valign="top">I Love this Pic, she looks so happy!</td>', 'I Love this Pic, she looks so happy!', '2006-04-22 15:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335077, 322092, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the pose, the expression.  I relate to rain as "fresh", too, so that works very well.  Not sure how you ended up with a bit of a green halo around the one hand, but it''s a nit and not significant to me.  Well done.</td>', 'Love the pose, the expression.  I relate to rain as "fresh", too, so that works very well.  Not sure how you ended up with a bit of a green halo around the one hand, but it''s a nit and not significant to me.  Well done.', '2006-04-22 15:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335083, 321310, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow - extra point for the sheer amount of work to set this up!  Well executed, too.</td>', 'Wow - extra point for the sheer amount of work to set this up!  Well executed, too.', '2006-04-22 15:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335084, 322036, 57169, '<td valign="top">What is new?</td>', 'What is new?', '2006-04-22 15:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335087, 322919, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great capture and excellent composition.</td>', 'Great capture and excellent composition.', '2006-04-22 15:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335089, 322014, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is simply delightful!</td>', 'This is simply delightful!', '2006-04-22 15:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335091, 323094, 22914, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.', '2006-04-22 15:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335093, 322548, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very richly detailed.  Color and depth make this "pop".</td>', 'Very richly detailed.  Color and depth make this "pop".', '2006-04-22 15:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335124, 322972, 30982, '<td valign="top">Truly a wonderful picture of spring with all the elements.  New colt, new blossoms, bew blooms and green grass.  Well captured.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-26 07:23:41.</i></td>', 'Truly a wonderful picture of spring with all the elements.  New colt, new blossoms, bew blooms and green grass.  Well captured.', '2006-04-22 15:17:17.000000', '2006-04-26 08:23:41.000000', 1),
(2335128, 321389, 30982, '<td valign="top">That''s not a dress, it''s a t-shirt, but it''s still a captivating photo.  Great expression, pose, and smile!</td>', 'That''s not a dress, it''s a t-shirt, but it''s still a captivating photo.  Great expression, pose, and smile!', '2006-04-22 15:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335129, 322375, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute, and carried the challenge theme without the title (which is also cute).</td>', 'Cute, and carried the challenge theme without the title (which is also cute).', '2006-04-22 15:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335146, 323015, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite appropriate for the challenge, and a lovely shot.</td>', 'Quite appropriate for the challenge, and a lovely shot.', '2006-04-22 15:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335149, 323120, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll get comments about a lack of focus.  I like the softness and the rich colors - and have decide I like the lack of sharp focus on this one.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll get comments about a lack of focus.  I like the softness and the rich colors - and have decide I like the lack of sharp focus on this one.', '2006-04-22 15:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335150, 323224, 30982, '<td valign="top">While you may have intended the foucs to be on the saddle for the purpose of the challenge (per the title), what I see is the delicate interaction between horse and rider.  I like the composition of this a great deal.</td>', 'While you may have intended the foucs to be on the saddle for the purpose of the challenge (per the title), what I see is the delicate interaction between horse and rider.  I like the composition of this a great deal.', '2006-04-22 15:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335152, 322551, 30982, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how "new" it is, but it''s a very interesting shot of a very interesting insect!  Great color, great detail in the insect''s wings.</td>', 'Don''t know how "new" it is, but it''s a very interesting shot of a very interesting insect!  Great color, great detail in the insect''s wings.', '2006-04-22 15:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335157, 323087, 30982, '<td valign="top">Someone wrapped an entire car for a challenge??  Because of the lighting (I''m assuming a flash) it almost looks as though the car is floating, which is a bit disconcerting.</td>', 'Someone wrapped an entire car for a challenge??  Because of the lighting (I''m assuming a flash) it almost looks as though the car is floating, which is a bit disconcerting.', '2006-04-22 15:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335159, 322357, 30982, '<td valign="top">Would have been a decent entry for "Jump" but don''t see the connection to this challenge.  There''s a sort of halo artifact above the roofline.</td>', 'Would have been a decent entry for "Jump" but don''t see the connection to this challenge.  There''s a sort of halo artifact above the roofline.', '2006-04-22 15:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335165, 323003, 30982, '<td valign="top">The colors are vibrant and the bokey is lovely, but it looks a bit overexposed to me and I''m not entirely fond of the centered composition.</td>', 'The colors are vibrant and the bokey is lovely, but it looks a bit overexposed to me and I''m not entirely fond of the centered composition.', '2006-04-22 15:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335167, 322490, 30982, '<td valign="top">While colorful, it''s not a "striking" subject.</td>', 'While colorful, it''s not a "striking" subject.', '2006-04-22 15:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335170, 322973, 30982, '<td valign="top">Even with the title it''s a stretch for the challenge.</td>', 'Even with the title it''s a stretch for the challenge.', '2006-04-22 15:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335179, 323019, 30982, '<td valign="top">The pink thing on the right draws attention away from the subject.  A little bit of additional light on the subject''s face would help draw her to you as well.  She''s certainly a gorgeous young lady!</td>', 'The pink thing on the right draws attention away from the subject.  A little bit of additional light on the subject''s face would help draw her to you as well.  She''s certainly a gorgeous young lady!', '2006-04-22 15:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335181, 321584, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is, to me, a nice candid but even with the title doesn''t really strike me as "something new".</td>', 'This is, to me, a nice candid but even with the title doesn''t really strike me as "something new".', '2006-04-22 15:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335186, 321894, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very interesting perspective on a clock but too something (harsly lit, too much contrast?) to see it well.</td>', 'A very interesting perspective on a clock but too something (harsly lit, too much contrast?) to see it well.', '2006-04-22 15:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335187, 320698, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not exactly sure how this fits the challenge.</td>', 'Not exactly sure how this fits the challenge.', '2006-04-22 15:45:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2335189, 321519, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this fits the challenge and is not a particularly interesting subject.</td>', 'Not sure how this fits the challenge and is not a particularly interesting subject.', '2006-04-22 15:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335190, 322349, 30982, '<td valign="top">New glasses, maybe?  An interesting candid but not seeing the connection to the challenge topic.</td>', 'New glasses, maybe?  An interesting candid but not seeing the connection to the challenge topic.', '2006-04-22 15:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335191, 322436, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit stark, which is what I''m sure you intended.  I''d have preferred the seedling less centered, though.</td>', 'A bit stark, which is what I''m sure you intended.  I''d have preferred the seedling less centered, though.', '2006-04-22 15:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335192, 322643, 30982, '<td valign="top">It appears the dirt behind rather than the seedlings themselves is in focus.</td>', 'It appears the dirt behind rather than the seedlings themselves is in focus.', '2006-04-22 15:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335221, 321052, 51553, '<td valign="top">I love it.  For both the statement and the image.</td>', 'I love it.  For both the statement and the image.', '2006-04-22 16:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335238, 322783, 57442, '<td valign="top">I really like the light</td>', 'I really like the light', '2006-04-22 16:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335244, 323096, 57442, '<td valign="top">This may be intentionally oof, if so, I can''t sort out why.</td>', 'This may be intentionally oof, if so, I can''t sort out why.', '2006-04-22 16:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335250, 323209, 57442, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s really light.</td>', 'Wow, that''s really light.', '2006-04-22 16:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335319, 322249, 57442, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That''s really great.</td>', 'Wow.  That''s really great.', '2006-04-22 17:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335322, 322659, 57442, '<td valign="top">shouldn''t the whole egg glow blue?</td>', 'shouldn''t the whole egg glow blue?', '2006-04-22 17:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335326, 321481, 57442, '<td valign="top">I love this, though it may be a touch dark.  Perhaps a slight midtone brighten would make the image pop a little much.</td>', 'I love this, though it may be a touch dark.  Perhaps a slight midtone brighten would make the image pop a little much.', '2006-04-22 17:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335381, 323080, 51538, '<td valign="top">Strangely enough, my daughter and I left an ootheca (mantid egg case, something like honeycomb material which holds many mantid young) on our sideboard and it hatched out overnight.  Well, there were about a hundred mini-mantids wandering around the dining room when we woke up this morning....  and we spent much of the day rounding them up and transfering them to the garden.  Nice photo, by the way.</td>', 'Strangely enough, my daughter and I left an ootheca (mantid egg case, something like honeycomb material which holds many mantid young) on our sideboard and it hatched out overnight.  Well, there were about a hundred mini-mantids wandering around the dining room when we woke up this morning....  and we spent much of the day rounding them up and transfering them to the garden.  Nice photo, by the way.', '2006-04-22 18:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335382, 322713, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp presentation.  The water droplet is the finishing touch.</td>', 'Nice crisp presentation.  The water droplet is the finishing touch.', '2006-04-22 18:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335383, 321038, 51538, '<td valign="top">A nice spring photo.</td>', 'A nice spring photo.', '2006-04-22 18:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335400, 322900, 46618, '<td valign="top">I love your photo!  The difference in colors is striking.  I wonder if you could add some more contrast to make the differences even more striking.  Just a thought.  Beautiful photo!</td>', 'I love your photo!  The difference in colors is striking.  I wonder if you could add some more contrast to make the differences even more striking.  Just a thought.  Beautiful photo!', '2006-04-22 18:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335413, 323107, 50674, '<td valign="top">absolutely wonderful shot, hope it does well ...</td>', 'absolutely wonderful shot, hope it does well ...', '2006-04-22 18:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335415, 322426, 46618, '<td valign="top">I live in Wyoming where horses are a huge part of our culture.  You have captured a beatiful photo of a beautiful horse!  I like the backlighting, well the lighting period.  Great job!</td>', 'I live in Wyoming where horses are a huge part of our culture.  You have captured a beatiful photo of a beautiful horse!  I like the backlighting, well the lighting period.  Great job!', '2006-04-22 18:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335562, 321996, 46821, '<td valign="top">ohh i want to be there</td>', 'ohh i want to be there', '2006-04-22 20:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
