(2336873, 323015, 57756, '<td valign="top">I would  rate this photograph as a 10/10.  It captures the innocence of a newborn child, the colours are etheral, you can almost reach out and feel the softness of skin, inhale the fragrance only new babies have.  The expression of contentment and the colour and placement of hands and feet exude innocence and the promise of all that is new and precious in life.  It is quite simply, beautiful.</td>', 'I would  rate this photograph as a 10/10.  It captures the innocence of a newborn child, the colours are etheral, you can almost reach out and feel the softness of skin, inhale the fragrance only new babies have.  The expression of contentment and the colour and placement of hands and feet exude innocence and the promise of all that is new and precious in life.  It is quite simply, beautiful.', '2006-04-23 17:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
