(2336963, 323086, 23430, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus on the background. It has unfortunately crept into your subjects a bit too.</td>', 'I like the soft focus on the background. It has unfortunately crept into your subjects a bit too.', '2006-04-23 18:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336972, 323092, 23430, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft at the front. I think colour would have looked better against the nice background you''ve chosen.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft at the front. I think colour would have looked better against the nice background you''ve chosen.', '2006-04-23 18:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336979, 322909, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great to catch such an act. It''s a bit hard to distinguish these guys as they all blend together.</td>', 'Great to catch such an act. It''s a bit hard to distinguish these guys as they all blend together.', '2006-04-23 18:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337011, 321894, 23430, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle. I think having all the circle of the clock face in and more light would have given it more appeal.</td>', 'Interesting angle. I think having all the circle of the clock face in and more light would have given it more appeal.', '2006-04-23 18:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337016, 322989, 23430, '<td valign="top">Good perspective and composition.</td>', 'Good perspective and composition.', '2006-04-23 18:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337021, 321896, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours in this one. I think the branch may have looked better going up insted of down.</td>', 'Nice colours in this one. I think the branch may have looked better going up insted of down.', '2006-04-23 18:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337036, 322421, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp foreground. A busy background is taking away from your subject.</td>', 'Nice sharp foreground. A busy background is taking away from your subject.', '2006-04-23 18:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337042, 323207, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice leaves and placement against a background that really helps to make them stand out. I''m no expert on lighting but I think there''s too much on your too left leaf and the the bottom is too much in shade.</td>', 'Nice leaves and placement against a background that really helps to make them stand out. I''m no expert on lighting but I think there''s too much on your too left leaf and the the bottom is too much in shade.', '2006-04-23 18:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337053, 321925, 23430, '<td valign="top">Lots of dark here, not sure if it''s a great look.</td>', 'Lots of dark here, not sure if it''s a great look.', '2006-04-23 18:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337055, 321808, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot. Bumping up.</td>', 'Nice simple shot. Bumping up.', '2006-04-23 18:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337059, 323224, 23430, '<td valign="top">A good shot in respect it''s interesting and it stands out nicely against the  plain background.</td>', 'A good shot in respect it''s interesting and it stands out nicely against the  plain background.', '2006-04-23 19:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337114, 322169, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think this would fit Something Old better.  I would like this better with sharper focus and less yellow.</td>', 'I think this would fit Something Old better.  I would like this better with sharper focus and less yellow.', '2006-04-23 19:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337116, 323057, 41574, '<td valign="top">Technically, one of the best shots I''ve seen (ever). I''m sure that this image was significantly "edited," but that''s not very relevant to its outstanding appeal. That said, I don''t very much buy its pertinence to the theme of "something new" (it makes the cut, but barely does so).</td>', 'Technically, one of the best shots I''ve seen (ever). I''m sure that this image was significantly "edited," but that''s not very relevant to its outstanding appeal. That said, I don''t very much buy its pertinence to the theme of "something new" (it makes the cut, but barely does so).', '2006-04-23 19:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337119, 320148, 41574, '<td valign="top">"3.5"...umm, "4."</td>', '"3.5"...umm, "4."', '2006-04-23 19:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337173, 321795, 8367, '<td valign="top">I love the delicate pink of the rose and it''s well captured.<br/>IMO, the photo would be improved by a tighter crop around just the rose. The black spots are not very attractive and the rocks are not helping the composition. They just pull your eye away from the beautiful subject.</td>', 'I love the delicate pink of the rose and it''s well captured.IMO, the photo would be improved by a tighter crop around just the rose. The black spots are not very attractive and the rocks are not helping the composition. They just pull your eye away from the beautiful subject.', '2006-04-23 19:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337184, 322951, 8367, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.</td>', 'Very nice capture.', '2006-04-23 20:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337200, 322954, 8367, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Congratulations! This would make a great square crop, just under the hands and a little past the elbows on each side. Nice background and the skin tones are wonderful.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Congratulations! This would make a great square crop, just under the hands and a little past the elbows on each side. Nice background and the skin tones are wonderful.', '2006-04-23 20:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337226, 322004, 8367, '<td valign="top">Good choice with selective desate. It keeps the attention on your subject/s.<br/>Great focus.</td>', 'Good choice with selective desate. It keeps the attention on your subject/s.Great focus.', '2006-04-23 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337233, 322972, 45790, '<td valign="top">Enjoyable shot. Sharp and good colors.</td>', 'Enjoyable shot. Sharp and good colors.', '2006-04-23 20:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
