(2338569, 322467, 38032, '<td valign="top">Hey! I have that too ... I wonder how many Mac-heads there are -- the images tend to look lighter on the Mac ... this one looks great.  Wonder why! :)</td>', 'Hey! I have that too ... I wonder how many Mac-heads there are -- the images tend to look lighter on the Mac ... this one looks great.  Wonder why! :)', '2006-04-24 08:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2338571, 322524, 38032, '<td valign="top">Gonna go ahead and predict that many people call this "interesting".  However, since it may be perceived as having an agenda you may be SOL as far as a score.  There isn''t much DOF or perspective but the writing is interesting and intriguing - curious what /  where this is.  Not scored yet. -- OK back again: 6 for now.</td>', 'Gonna go ahead and predict that many people call this "interesting".  However, since it may be perceived as having an agenda you may be SOL as far as a score.  There isn''t much DOF or perspective but the writing is interesting and intriguing - curious what /  where this is.  Not scored yet. -- OK back again: 6 for now.', '2006-04-24 08:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2338572, 323209, 38032, '<td valign="top">you must be on a PC ... my mac makes this look all grey without black areas.  how''s that lens?</td>', 'you must be on a PC ... my mac makes this look all grey without black areas.  how''s that lens?', '2006-04-24 08:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2338574, 321625, 38032, '<td valign="top">awesome ... If it weren''t for the "sun?" I would think this was at the butterfly exhibits ?</td>', 'awesome ... If it weren''t for the "sun?" I would think this was at the butterfly exhibits ?', '2006-04-24 08:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2338579, 323157, 38032, '<td valign="top">The lighting is daring here. Since this is a studio type image, I might have shifted things around a bit and used a gigantic wide coffee cup ...  and perhaps tried to make the model look less intimidating (since the title is "fresh start" ... but this guy looks like he''s getting ready to lay off 16 employees (I guess that would be a fresh start for them too :) ! Nonetheless, I''m usually not that picky - especially with a perfectly lit images such as this.  7</td>', 'The lighting is daring here. Since this is a studio type image, I might have shifted things around a bit and used a gigantic wide coffee cup ...  and perhaps tried to make the model look less intimidating (since the title is "fresh start" ... but this guy looks like he''s getting ready to lay off 16 employees (I guess that would be a fresh start for them too :) ! Nonetheless, I''m usually not that picky - especially with a perfectly lit images such as this.  7', '2006-04-24 08:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2338581, 322638, 38032, '<td valign="top">Stunning and balanced. The wave highlight and sun''s reflection are subtle and effective elements.</td>', 'Stunning and balanced. The wave highlight and sun''s reflection are subtle and effective elements.', '2006-04-24 08:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2338582, 321476, 38032, '<td valign="top">beautiful. fave.</td>', 'beautiful. fave.', '2006-04-24 08:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
