(2339721, 322512, 31606, '<td valign="top">This image has great potential.   The composition IMO is great.  I really like the solid black background and I think the flowers are placed just right.  One of the things that will hurt you is that it looks as if you have used a direct flash on your subject causing it to be too bright.  A flash that you can bounce off of a ceiling or if you were outside try and get the sunlight to work in your favor.    The other thing would be that it seems the focus is off just a tad.  It seems to me that the focus is on the branch and not the flowers.  I hope this helps.</td>', 'This image has great potential.   The composition IMO is great.  I really like the solid black background and I think the flowers are placed just right.  One of the things that will hurt you is that it looks as if you have used a direct flash on your subject causing it to be too bright.  A flash that you can bounce off of a ceiling or if you were outside try and get the sunlight to work in your favor.    The other thing would be that it seems the focus is off just a tad.  It seems to me that the focus is on the branch and not the flowers.  I hope this helps.', '2006-04-24 17:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
