(2340670, 322584, 55957, '<td valign="top">I think it''s just a little too dark.</td>', 'I think it''s just a little too dark.', '2006-04-25 00:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2340671, 322711, 55957, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, strong contrast, which is good, but the composition doesn''t excite me.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, strong contrast, which is good, but the composition doesn''t excite me.', '2006-04-25 00:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2340697, 320386, 55957, '<td valign="top">New word, too? Hehhe. Germaneering has a nice ring to it. I like it. <br/>Nice colour and contrast. It could stand to be a bit sharper, and it''s a little overwhelming, there''s a lot going on, and it lacks focus. (by this I don''t mean actual sharpness, I mean a place that draws the eye.) The reflections are interesting. If I were to change it, I''d crop it closer to the top, so the BMW crest is more prominant, and some of the more distracting and busy chrome is cropped out. This way, the curvy lines along the body would draw the eye up to the crest, and there would be a stronger contrast between the black and the yellow.</td>', 'New word, too? Hehhe. Germaneering has a nice ring to it. I like it. Nice colour and contrast. It could stand to be a bit sharper, and it''s a little overwhelming, there''s a lot going on, and it lacks focus. (by this I don''t mean actual sharpness, I mean a place that draws the eye.) The reflections are interesting. If I were to change it, I''d crop it closer to the top, so the BMW crest is more prominant, and some of the more distracting and busy chrome is cropped out. This way, the curvy lines along the body would draw the eye up to the crest, and there would be a stronger contrast between the black and the yellow.', '2006-04-25 00:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2340702, 322125, 55957, '<td valign="top">I feel like it should be rotated a couple degrees counterclockwise, but other than that, it''s an impressive image. I love that the detail remains in the clouds, so that it''s not simply a wash of white, but a presence above the buildings.</td>', 'I feel like it should be rotated a couple degrees counterclockwise, but other than that, it''s an impressive image. I love that the detail remains in the clouds, so that it''s not simply a wash of white, but a presence above the buildings.', '2006-04-25 00:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2340720, 320537, 16924, '<td valign="top">Nice light!</td>', 'Nice light!', '2006-04-25 00:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2340723, 322687, 55957, '<td valign="top">I think the border was a bad decision for this shot. While it does a good job of encasing the photograph, the color being almsot exactly that of the plant detracts from the impression that so much green makes against the field of white in the background, and again with the brown stake. Setting this aside, the color of the image is great, nice and simple. Excellent focus, and the bug makes it more interesting that it might have been.</td>', 'I think the border was a bad decision for this shot. While it does a good job of encasing the photograph, the color being almsot exactly that of the plant detracts from the impression that so much green makes against the field of white in the background, and again with the brown stake. Setting this aside, the color of the image is great, nice and simple. Excellent focus, and the bug makes it more interesting that it might have been.', '2006-04-25 00:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2340732, 322852, 55957, '<td valign="top">My first reaction to this was "what the hell?!" and then I started laughing. hehe. I like it. great texture, and colour contrast.</td>', 'My first reaction to this was "what the hell?!" and then I started laughing. hehe. I like it. great texture, and colour contrast.', '2006-04-25 00:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2340754, 320263, 55957, '<td valign="top">So much pink! ouch! Hehe. Personal bias against pink aside, good solid photo. Great focus, it''s where it needs to be, and despite the lightness of all the colours, and the predominance of white in the background, it doesn''t seem too bright. Good Job.</td>', 'So much pink! ouch! Hehe. Personal bias against pink aside, good solid photo. Great focus, it''s where it needs to be, and despite the lightness of all the colours, and the predominance of white in the background, it doesn''t seem too bright. Good Job.', '2006-04-25 00:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2340808, 322092, 4210, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent and fabulous happy image.</td>', 'This is an excellent and fabulous happy image.', '2006-04-25 00:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2341089, 323208, 10420, '<td valign="top">Very good closeup photo. Nice details. The sky is overdone a bit - the blue (almost neon-like) looks unnatural. Also you could use a bit of fill flash to eliminate the dark parts in the centre.</td>', 'Very good closeup photo. Nice details. The sky is overdone a bit - the blue (almost neon-like) looks unnatural. Also you could use a bit of fill flash to eliminate the dark parts in the centre.', '2006-04-25 04:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
