(2345074, 323015, 3882, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!  i''m so excited to have won.  I photographed this little angel on the night the challenge began, but I had no idea of the challenge.  I was simply practicing newborn shots for a friend.  Then, on the 18th I discovered the topic and thought, hey I could try this photo, it fit.  Much to my surprise and joy, it did well, very well!  <br/> <br/>Thank you so very much for everyone who voted and especially all of those who left comments.  It is a huge thrill for me to have won this contest!</td>', 'WOW!!!  i''m so excited to have won.  I photographed this little angel on the night the challenge began, but I had no idea of the challenge.  I was simply practicing newborn shots for a friend.  Then, on the 18th I discovered the topic and thought, hey I could try this photo, it fit.  Much to my surprise and joy, it did well, very well!   Thank you so very much for everyone who voted and especially all of those who left comments.  It is a huge thrill for me to have won this contest!', '2006-04-26 07:29:09.000000', NULL, 0),
