(2345667, 323015, 3882, '<td valign="top">A comment about the large flower - we put it there for two reasons, one, we wanted to avoid showing the nether regions, but in this pose, she moved.  The second reason was she had the clamp on the umbilical cord still attached and it didn''t look very pretty, so we put the flower in front of it to hide it.<br/>The baby is actually lying in a large sea shell, but for this image i had zoomed in close.  It was remarked that the image is very much like Anne Geddes, it was not my intent to imitate her, I was simply trying to create a beautiful image of a 4 day old girl for her parents.  I hope it was not thought that I intentionally copied her images or anything.<br/> <br/></td>', 'A comment about the large flower - we put it there for two reasons, one, we wanted to avoid showing the nether regions, but in this pose, she moved.  The second reason was she had the clamp on the umbilical cord still attached and it didn''t look very pretty, so we put the flower in front of it to hide it.The baby is actually lying in a large sea shell, but for this image i had zoomed in close.  It was remarked that the image is very much like Anne Geddes, it was not my intent to imitate her, I was simply trying to create a beautiful image of a 4 day old girl for her parents.  I hope it was not thought that I intentionally copied her images or anything. ', '2006-04-26 09:50:18.000000', NULL, 0),
