(2346301, 322403, 32776, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  It''s an Eastern Redbud (at least according to the sign by the tree), and the buds were actually coming off the main part of the trunk - this was the largest cluster, much lower than where the tree started branching and had most of its flowers and leaves.<br/> <br/>I agree that the highlights on the flowers are a problem - hadn''t thought about it in terms of overall overexposure but that definitely makes sense looking at it now.  I also see the focus issues.  I''ll have to look back through some of the other pictures I took of it to see if they work better in those areas.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  It''s an Eastern Redbud (at least according to the sign by the tree), and the buds were actually coming off the main part of the trunk - this was the largest cluster, much lower than where the tree started branching and had most of its flowers and leaves. I agree that the highlights on the flowers are a problem - hadn''t thought about it in terms of overall overexposure but that definitely makes sense looking at it now.  I also see the focus issues.  I''ll have to look back through some of the other pictures I took of it to see if they work better in those areas.', '2006-04-26 13:06:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2346310, 322805, 42100, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the strong finish, and a new personal best!  It is a great image and great improvement for you, keep doing your happy dance over this one.</td>', 'Congrats on the strong finish, and a new personal best!  It is a great image and great improvement for you, keep doing your happy dance over this one.', '2006-04-26 13:08:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2346318, 321754, 49384, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments and critiques.  My camera doesn''t do well in low lighting, and I wanted to avoid using the flash because of the weird shadows it casts.  I''ll try to redo this in daylight like I had planned, see if that helps.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments and critiques.  My camera doesn''t do well in low lighting, and I wanted to avoid using the flash because of the weird shadows it casts.  I''ll try to redo this in daylight like I had planned, see if that helps.', '2006-04-26 13:11:24.000000', NULL, 0),
