(2346827, 322914, 19708, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by eyewave:</b></div><hr/><i> good composition and DOF, background would have been better without the lines </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Copy it, paint over them and see what it looks like. I did and thought it lost it''s depth and having them in there actually helped balance the shot as a real-world encounter vs. a sterile studio kinda'' shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-26 14:07:43.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by eyewave: good composition and DOF, background would have been better without the lines  Copy it, paint over them and see what it looks like. I did and thought it lost it''s depth and having them in there actually helped balance the shot as a real-world encounter vs. a sterile studio kinda'' shot.', '2006-04-26 15:07:07.000000', '2006-04-26 15:07:43.000000', 0),
