(2347329, 321389, 56673, '<td valign="top">I just think this is an outstanding photo!  Such pure emotion, such a vivid picture.  I gave it a 9, and I give very, very few scores that high.</td>', 'I just think this is an outstanding photo!  Such pure emotion, such a vivid picture.  I gave it a 9, and I give very, very few scores that high.', '2006-04-26 17:03:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2347398, 322649, 40718, '<td valign="top">OK, I gave this one a 3 on the vote through.  That seems pretty harsh considering you got a 5.15.  My thoughts:<br/> <br/>1) The composition is quite centered.  Try to move the subject to one side (usually the right side with space on the left).<br/>2) The thing that really got me was the supersaturation.  The pink line that is just to the right of the bud looks completely blown out and that doesn''t make for a good look.  You can also see the saturation in the red dots on the bud itself.<br/>3) The lighting is a bit harsh.  perhaps try in the morning or evening.<br/> <br/>Good things are the nice DOF and the sharp focus of the subject.  I think you did well there.</td>', 'OK, I gave this one a 3 on the vote through.  That seems pretty harsh considering you got a 5.15.  My thoughts: 1) The composition is quite centered.  Try to move the subject to one side (usually the right side with space on the left).2) The thing that really got me was the supersaturation.  The pink line that is just to the right of the bud looks completely blown out and that doesn''t make for a good look.  You can also see the saturation in the red dots on the bud itself.3) The lighting is a bit harsh.  perhaps try in the morning or evening. Good things are the nice DOF and the sharp focus of the subject.  I think you did well there.', '2006-04-26 17:20:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2347690, 322092, 32997, '<td valign="top">great energy-love your composition..<br/>congrats..well deserved..</td>', 'great energy-love your composition..congrats..well deserved..', '2006-04-26 18:55:04.000000', NULL, 0),
