(2350334, 322805, 42125, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on all those high jumpin goals:<br/>Goals for 2006 on DPC <br/>Get above a 5.0 on a photo <br/>Get above a 5.5 on a photo <br/>Get above a 6.0 on a photo <br/>Get above a 6.5 on a photo <br/> <br/>Get in the top 100, I mean, COME ON <br/>Get in the top 75 <br/>Get in the top 50 <br/>Get in the top 25 <br/>Get in the top 10 <br/> <br/>This picture is surely worth it!</td>', 'Congratulations on all those high jumpin goals:Goals for 2006 on DPC Get above a 5.0 on a photo Get above a 5.5 on a photo Get above a 6.0 on a photo Get above a 6.5 on a photo  Get in the top 100, I mean, COME ON Get in the top 75 Get in the top 50 Get in the top 25 Get in the top 10  This picture is surely worth it!', '2006-04-27 11:23:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2350741, 322659, 53964, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments :)<br/>Yes, the whole egg should be blue, but with the led penlight I have I couldn''t manage to get it to light the whole thing without getting a hotspot in the middle of the front, so I did the best I could to get an even light over as much as possible.</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments :)Yes, the whole egg should be blue, but with the led penlight I have I couldn''t manage to get it to light the whole thing without getting a hotspot in the middle of the front, so I did the best I could to get an even light over as much as possible.', '2006-04-27 13:46:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2351082, 323104, 43148, '<td valign="top">Hmm, 17 votes UNDER 4? LOL, gotta laugh! Very new looking buds, so think it meets the challenge fine, and I think it is a very well done photo, did not vote on it, probably would be in among the 85 if I had! Only thing it lacks to me is contrasting colors, and I understand that is the way it is, but just a little bit of red/blue/yellow or other color would have helped out quite a bit, IMO&lt; only, we know!!! lol<br/> <br/>Jacque</td>', 'Hmm, 17 votes UNDER 4? LOL, gotta laugh! Very new looking buds, so think it meets the challenge fine, and I think it is a very well done photo, did not vote on it, probably would be in among the 85 if I had! Only thing it lacks to me is contrasting colors, and I understand that is the way it is, but just a little bit of red/blue/yellow or other color would have helped out quite a bit, IMO< only, we know!!! lol Jacque', '2006-04-27 16:36:28.000000', NULL, 0),
