(2351688, 323057, 53147, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a great shot - one of my few 10s. Love the colors and the detail. I liked the light box - didn;t find it distracting at all. Being a guy, I was not aware of the new spring colors but the shot worked great. Well done. Shame it didnt go higher but 18th place isn''t anything to sneeze at.</td>', 'I thought this was a great shot - one of my few 10s. Love the colors and the detail. I liked the light box - didn;t find it distracting at all. Being a guy, I was not aware of the new spring colors but the shot worked great. Well done. Shame it didnt go higher but 18th place isn''t anything to sneeze at.', '2006-04-27 21:04:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2351740, 322548, 51538, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites from the challenge - did not have time to leave a note when I voted.  Lovely green colour - just what I imagine NZ to be (I was brought up in a more golden, arid Australia; entirely different colours).</td>', 'One of my favourites from the challenge - did not have time to leave a note when I voted.  Lovely green colour - just what I imagine NZ to be (I was brought up in a more golden, arid Australia; entirely different colours).', '2006-04-27 21:30:24.000000', NULL, 0),
