(2352321, 322092, 24454, '<td valign="top">I can''t get over what an aMAZING shot ths is!!!  WOW!  I am so glad it is on our home page staring at me every time I come to press update on my . . .ummmmm. . . very much less than ribbon winning score  :)<br/> <br/>Congratulations on the ribbon and the perfect photo!!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I can''t get over what an aMAZING shot ths is!!!  WOW!  I am so glad it is on our home page staring at me every time I come to press update on my . . .ummmmm. . . very much less than ribbon winning score  :) Congratulations on the ribbon and the perfect photo!!!! ', '2006-04-28 01:10:50.000000', NULL, 0),
