(2353537, 323104, 2490, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal, and I like the dark vs. light.  There is some little thingy on the left that I would either like to see just a little better or not see at all.  The greens are probably very accurate, but they make me think "pea soup" right off the bat.  I think it would have helped to use Hue/Saturation and possibly generate a little more punch.  I could be wrong, but that''s my thoughts.  Love the composition!</td>', 'I like the diagonal, and I like the dark vs. light.  There is some little thingy on the left that I would either like to see just a little better or not see at all.  The greens are probably very accurate, but they make me think "pea soup" right off the bat.  I think it would have helped to use Hue/Saturation and possibly generate a little more punch.  I could be wrong, but that''s my thoughts.  Love the composition!', '2006-04-28 14:45:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2353673, 323015, 9391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful take Diane. Congratulations!</td>', 'Wonderful take Diane. Congratulations!', '2006-04-28 15:31:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2353870, 322666, 2490, '<td valign="top">I really like the pose.  It''s a shame you couldn''t fill more of the frame, because the little arch above them is slightly distracting, but I''m betting you ran out of telephoto.  Somehow there seems to be a bit of a purple tint.  Shooting through glass?  They almost appear conjoined :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I really like the pose.  It''s a shame you couldn''t fill more of the frame, because the little arch above them is slightly distracting, but I''m betting you ran out of telephoto.  Somehow there seems to be a bit of a purple tint.  Shooting through glass?  They almost appear conjoined :) ', '2006-04-28 17:01:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2354249, 322092, 52352, '<td valign="top">This picture has a lot of energy. I like it.</td>', 'This picture has a lot of energy. I like it.', '2006-04-28 19:22:34.000000', NULL, 0),
