(2371971, 323090, 36499, '<td valign="top">this is a very nice flower photo(im a flower nut myself) Im curious why that one petal(center) doesnt look like it meets right 1/2 way down on the left side and why theres a straight line across the middle of the same petal. you dont list a lighten brush as one of your steps...would love to know what ya did to this.<br/> <br/>~~Cher~~ :o)</td>', 'this is a very nice flower photo(im a flower nut myself) Im curious why that one petal(center) doesnt look like it meets right 1/2 way down on the left side and why theres a straight line across the middle of the same petal. you dont list a lighten brush as one of your steps...would love to know what ya did to this. ~~Cher~~ :o)', '2006-05-02 11:44:54.000000', NULL, 0),
