(2372167, 320603, 37608, '<td valign="top">:: Critique Club ::<br/> <br/> Well the colors in this photo are awesome I like the way the pedals really stand out on the blue background. It is a great sharp image with just enough depth of field. The crop on it works very well the only thing that might help me is if the photo was rotated just a hair CCW. the leaves do a great job leading your eye into the flowers as well. I am guessing this is a potted plant that you shoot on a paper background, but you did a great job giving it a outside feel. One thing I think that would really help to give this a new fresh feel is if you would have used a spray bottle to just mist the flowers a little giving it the morning dew appearance.<br/> <br/> Great job with this photo, nothing to creative, but a technically sound photo.<br/> <br/></td>', ':: Critique Club ::  Well the colors in this photo are awesome I like the way the pedals really stand out on the blue background. It is a great sharp image with just enough depth of field. The crop on it works very well the only thing that might help me is if the photo was rotated just a hair CCW. the leaves do a great job leading your eye into the flowers as well. I am guessing this is a potted plant that you shoot on a paper background, but you did a great job giving it a outside feel. One thing I think that would really help to give this a new fresh feel is if you would have used a spray bottle to just mist the flowers a little giving it the morning dew appearance.  Great job with this photo, nothing to creative, but a technically sound photo. ', '2006-05-02 12:54:42.000000', NULL, 0),
