(2476306, 322951, 16230, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! Very well done. I''ve been trying to photograph hummingbirds myself lately and I found that it isn''t an easy thing to do well.<br/> <br/>My wife and I used to surf at Bolsa Chica all the time. It''s a great place. Watch out for rattlesnakes in those wetlands. We''ve seen several of them there over the years. Nasty little beasts!<br/></td>', 'Excellent shot! Very well done. I''ve been trying to photograph hummingbirds myself lately and I found that it isn''t an easy thing to do well. My wife and I used to surf at Bolsa Chica all the time. It''s a great place. Watch out for rattlesnakes in those wetlands. We''ve seen several of them there over the years. Nasty little beasts!', '2006-06-01 15:21:03.000000', NULL, 0),
