(2704869, 322153, 48228, '<td valign="top">I really love this one of your ducklings, as they almost look like they have been painted, and I love that painterly feel they have. Some of my work looks like that, so we have something in common. I am adding this one to my favorites and you as well as a favorite photographer. For someone so young you have a true gift.....</td>', 'I really love this one of your ducklings, as they almost look like they have been painted, and I love that painterly feel they have. Some of my work looks like that, so we have something in common. I am adding this one to my favorites and you as well as a favorite photographer. For someone so young you have a true gift.....', '2006-08-08 01:44:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2726520, 322490, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''ve decided to go through and give a comment to each user who registered on my birthday (April 6) of this year... perhaps I''ll go back to other years as well. Anyway... this photo makes me want chocolate!!  Your exposure seems quite off... as does your focus...sometimes it is difficult for cameras to focus in macro mode and you have to be a little more patient. The lighting here is very harsh... but yeah... yum!</td>', 'I''ve decided to go through and give a comment to each user who registered on my birthday (April 6) of this year... perhaps I''ll go back to other years as well. Anyway... this photo makes me want chocolate!!  Your exposure seems quite off... as does your focus...sometimes it is difficult for cameras to focus in macro mode and you have to be a little more patient. The lighting here is very harsh... but yeah... yum!', '2006-08-14 18:37:08.000000', NULL, 0),
